   "jp": "店の外",
   "en": "Go outside",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES78:186c0",
   "off": 100032,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「化け物どもを追い払って\r  くれたんだって？」\u0010",
   "en": "\"I hear you drove those monsters off?\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES78:186f4",
   "off": 100084,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「おかげで助かったよ」\u0010",
   "en": "\"You really saved us.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES78:18717",
   "off": 100119,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「明日から 再び船が出せる\r  ようになるだろう」\u0010",
   "en": "\"The boats should be able to sail again from tomorrow.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES78:1874c",
   "off": 100172,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「あの時は世話になったな」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Thanks for helping me out back then.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES78:1876d",
   "off": 100205,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「助けていただき\r  ありがとうございました」\u0010",
   "en": "\"Thank you for rescuing me.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES78:187a0",
   "off": 100256,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "「あんたらだったのか\r  息子を助け出してくれた\r  のは…\u0010\b",
   "en": "\"So you're the ones who brought my boy back, eh...\u0010\b",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "ROOMES78:187da",
   "off": 100314,
   "op": "22",
   "group": "dialogue",
   "jp": "  よし  わしが要塞に\r  船を出してやろう\u0010\b  港のはずれの堤防で\r  待っとるぞ」\u0010",
   "en": "Right, then. I'll ferry ya out to the fortress myself.\u0010\bI'll be waitin' on the breakwater at the far end of the harbour.\"\u0010",
   "kind": "text",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  }
 ]
}
